.TH MYSTRCAT 3 "2024" "libmyutils" "User Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.PP
.B int mystrcat(char *dest, const char *src);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrcat()
function appends the string pointed to by
.IR src
to the end of the string pointed to by
.IR dest .
The null terminator of
.IR dest
is overwritten and a new null terminator is added at the end.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the total length of the resulting string.
